<BaseLayout
  title="Acoustic Strips Dubai | Self-Adhesive Rubber Isolation | Rukn Al Zain"
  description="Self-adhesive acoustic strips made from recycled tire rubber, used beneath decking and as perimeter isolation to reduce sound and vibration transfer across Dubai developments."
